Output demo.gif
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set Theme "MaterialDarker"
Set Padding 10


Set Shell bash
Type './tagselecta read "./Cantti - Echoes of the Woods"'
Enter
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+C

Type './tagselecta write "./Cantti - Echoes of the Woods" -g "Reggae; Dub" -N 5'
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
